## 2. BUSINESS MODEL

Initial packages:

1. Starter
   - 500 THB/month
   - General customer / small business
   - One-page or 1–3 pages
   - Basic SEO
   - Small monthly change quota

2. SME Growth
   - 999 THB/month
   - SME
   - 5–7 pages
   - Blog/news
   - Analytics and Search Console
   - Schema and stronger SEO
   - 2 monthly change requests

3. Business Pro
   - 1,999 THB/month
   - Medium business
   - 8–12 pages
   - Optional multilingual support
   - Multiple customer users
   - Reports and advanced support
   - 4 monthly change requests

Commercial rules:

- Default contract term: 12 months
- Revenue sources:
  - Monthly subscription
  - Setup fee
  - Add-ons
  - Extra change requests
  - Domain and email services
  - Renewal
  - Partner and reseller revenue
- Price, tax, currency and package availability may vary by country

