## 3. PRIMARY USERS

Internal roles:

- Super Admin
- Management
- Sales Manager
- Sales
- Finance Manager
- Finance
- Onboarding Coordinator
- Content Specialist
- Website Implementer
- QA Officer
- Support Manager
- Support Agent
- Partner Manager

External roles:

- Customer Owner
- Customer Editor
- Customer Approver
- Partner / Reseller
- Public visitor
- Token-based quotation viewer
- Token-based contract signer
- Token-based website reviewer

Authorization model:

- RBAC
- Deny by default
- Scope-aware authorization:
  - platform
  - country
  - legal entity
  - organization
  - tenant
  - team
  - assigned record
  - partner portfolio
  - self

UI visibility is not authorization.
All permission and scope checks must be enforced server-side.

---

## 4. MULTI-TENANT HIERARCHY

Customer Account
→ Organization
→ Tenant
→ Website

Definitions:

- Customer Account: ผู้ซื้อหรือบัญชีลูกค้า
- Organization: บริษัทหรือนิติบุคคล
- Tenant: พื้นที่ข้อมูลและสิทธิ์ของบริการหนึ่งชุด
- Website: เว็บไซต์หนึ่งแห่งภายใต้ Tenant

Rules:

- Transactional customer data must include tenant scope
- Cross-tenant access is forbidden unless explicitly authorized
- Users may belong to multiple organizations or tenants
- Tenant switcher is shown only when the user has access to multiple tenants
- Country-specific pricing, tax, language and timezone must be configurable

