## 6. READINESS MODEL

Readiness score:

- 80–100: Ready
- 60–79: Conditional
- Below 60: Not Ready

Rules:

- Missing critical fields can block production regardless of score
- Manual readiness override requires approval and reason
- Readiness result must record:
  - overall score
  - state
  - category scores
  - missing critical fields
  - override reason
  - override approver

---

