Created
→ Invitation Sent
→ Intake Started
→ Intake Submitted
→ Information Review
→ More Information Required
→ Ready for Production
→ Completed

Terminal states:

- Cancelled

### Production Job

Queued
→ Intake Review
→ Content Drafting
→ Content Review
→ Website Assembly
→ Internal QA
→ Client Review
→ Revision
→ Final Approval
→ Domain Setup
→ Deploying
→ Live

Alternative states:

- On Hold
- Cancelled

### Ticket

New
→ Assigned
→ In Progress
→ Waiting for Customer
→ QA
→ Completed
→ Closed

Alternative:

- Reopened
- Cancelled

### Invoice

Draft
→ Issued
→ Partially Paid
→ Paid

Alternative:

- Overdue
- Cancelled
- Refunded

