## 13. RECOMMENDED TECH STACK

Frontend:

- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v4
- shadcn/ui
- React Hook Form
- Zod
- TanStack Query where client-side state is needed

Backend:

Recommended options:

Option A:
- Next.js API / Route Handlers
- Service and domain layers

Option B:
- Node.js
- NestJS
- Separate API service

Database:

- PostgreSQL recommended
- MySQL acceptable if required by existing infrastructure
- ORM: Prisma or Drizzle

Infrastructure:

- AWS S3-compatible media storage
- CDN
- Managed PostgreSQL/MySQL
- Railway, AWS or equivalent deployment
- Background job queue
- Email / LINE / SMS provider
- Payment provider
- DNS and SSL provider
- AI provider abstraction

Observability:

- structured logging
- request ID
- error tracking
- metrics
- queue monitoring
- deployment monitoring
- audit trail

